   "design": "The agenda and process information come from a standard template. The procedural order fills from the case record and the agreed fees, witness numbers and timetable, and the arbitrator writes any special terms. The case records app holds fees and the timetable and sets hearing dates and deadlines with reminders, instead of a spreadsheet and calendar entries. No model is used. Scheduling, the meeting, settling details, signing, sending and questions stay with the arbitrator.",
